      "name": "Entry 21: hypothesis — the resolution gap is a parameter problem, not a DEM problem",
      "text": "The behavioural constants are functions of (Δx, terrain-roughness regime), not of Δx alone: the fitted trio (k_s 0.9375, ε₀ 0.0632, climbThr 0.025) bridges the gap per-ride on all three rider corpora but closes only ~55% of censo's gap.",
